@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"

Feature: WWW Homepage
	Frontend testing for the www homepage

Scenario: Platform Dropdown Navigation
	End users should be able to view all links in the platform dropdown.

	Given I go to the www homepage
	And I click on the "Digital Experience Platform" product link on the Platform dropdown
	Then there should be no errors on the page
	And the current url content should contain the text "www-uat.liferay.com"
	When I go to the www homepage
	And I click on the "Liferay Experience Cloud" product link on the Platform dropdown
	Then there should be no errors on the page
	And the current url content should contain the text "www-uat.liferay.com"

